  "description": "<p data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"277\">NBA 2K23 is een realistische <strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"88\">sport- en basketbalgame</strong> waarin je de volledige NBA-ervaring beleeft, van snelle wedstrijden tot uitgebreide carrièremodi. Je speelt met actuele teams en spelers en kunt zowel offline als online de strijd aangaan.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"414\">De game staat bekend om zijn gedetailleerde graphics, realistische gameplay en uitgebreide spelmodi zoals MyCareer, MyTeam en Play Now.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"419\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"432\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"451\"><strong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"451\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"456\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"473\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"712\">\r\n<li data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"537\">\r\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"537\">🏀 Realistische NBA-licentie met officiële teams en spelers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"592\">\r\n<p data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"592\">🎮 Verschillende spelmodi zoals MyCareer en MyTeam</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"627\">\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"627\">🌍 Online en offline speelbaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"671\">🧠 Diepgaande gameplay met veel tactiek</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"712\">\r\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"712\">👥 Geschikt voor solo en multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"739\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<li data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"769\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"802\">\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"802\">Genre: Sportgame (basketbal)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"847\">Spelers: 1–4 lokaal / online multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"882\">Taal: Meertalig (incl. Engels)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"905\">Uitgever: 2K Games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"922\">Editie: 2K23</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<p data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"948\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"973\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<li data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"991\">Gamecartridge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1012\">Origineel doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1043\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1080\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1080\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
